    "title": {
      "en": "Myth Track Gear Awarded from Delve Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5",
      "es": "Myth Track Gear otorgado por Delve Labyrinths en el parche 12.1.5"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Myth Track Gear Awarded from Delve Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5...",
      "es": "Myth Track Gear otorgado por Delve Labyrinths en el parche 12.1.5..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac6b1f20431d7.46054765\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The Labyrinth of Kindo'jan releases on October 13th with Patch 12.1.5, and players can get a piece of Myth track gear from Labyrinths!<br><br>After you unlock Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5 and you complete the introduction quest, a new NPC, <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/npc=264886/wahdu\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Wah'du</span></a>, will be at the entrance and have a quest for you. This quest will task you with going to a chamber in the Labyrinth and finishing the objective there on Tier 8 or above.<br><br>Completing the quest will earn you one <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/item=285065/mythical-soul-fragment\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Mythical Soul Fragment\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_argus_soulbombdebufflarge.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Mythical Soul Fragment</span></a> and 2,000 <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/currency=2803/undercoin\"><span><img alt=\"Undercoin\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_elvencoins.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Undercoin</span></span></a>. On PTR, Wah'du will then have another similar quest for you, but for another zone, but it's likely that on live servers these quests are Weekly Gated. Once you complete 3 quests and have 3 Mythical Soul Fragments, you can combine them to get a Myth 1/<wbr>6 piece of gear. The best part is that you can choose the slot that you want it for!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304888.png\" id=\"1304888\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304888.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Selection Window\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.22639 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>If you're looking for a piece of Myth track gear, this is a great way to spend some Myth crests once Patch 12.1.5 comes out.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>The Labyrinth of Kindo'jan releases on October 13th with Patch 12.1.5, and players can get a piece of Myth track gear from Labyrinths!<br /><br />After you unlock Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5 and you complete the introduction quest, a new NPC, <a href=\"/npc=264886/wahdu\">Wah'du</a>, will be at the entrance and have a quest for you. This quest will task you with going to a chamber in the Labyrinth and finishing the objective there on Tier 8 or above.<br /><br />Completing the quest will earn you one <a href=\"/item=285065/mythical-soul-fragment\">Mythical Soul Fragment</a> and 2,000 <a href=\"/currency=2803/undercoin\">Undercoin</a>. On PTR, Wah'du will then have another similar quest for you, but for another zone, but it's likely that on live servers these quests are Weekly Gated. Once you complete 3 quests and have 3 Mythical Soul Fragments, you can combine them to get a Myth 1/6 piece of gear. The best part is that you can choose the slot that you want it for!<br /><br />If you're looking for a piece of Myth track gear, this is a great way to spend some Myth crests once Patch 12.1.5 comes out.</noscript>            \n        ",
